269:Increasing the replication factor to 3 ensures that the internal Kafka Streams topic can tolerate up to 2 broker failures. The tradeoff from moving to the default values to the recommended ones is that some performance and more storage space (3x with the replication factor of 3) are sacrificed for more resiliency.
